<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37345" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praebĭtĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		praebeo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a giving</i>, <i>furnishing.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen. (ante-class.),
			Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 152,
			33</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			In partic., <i>a supplying</i>, <i>providing</i> for the use of the State (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gravari copiarum praebitione,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just. 38, 10, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adventitiae olei frumentique,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aur.
						Vict. Caes. 41, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">injusta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. 2
					Macc. 4, 14</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
